const body = "<section class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"pgtitle\"><span class=\"tag\">Insights</span><h1>Notes on marketing &nbsp;<span>engineering.</span></h1><p>Ideas, experiments and quick SEO / PPC / AI teardowns from a marketer who builds. New posts as I ship them.</p><p style=\"margin-top:14px\"><a href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/feed.xml\" style=\"color:var(--accent2);font-weight:700\">Subscribe via RSS →</a></p></div><div class=\"posts\">\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/i-built-a-cover-letter-generator-that-writes-in-my-voice.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>Build</b><span>2026-08-09</span><span>5 min read</span></div><h2>I Built a Cover Letter Generator That Writes in My Voice</h2><p>Every job seeker sends the same template CV. I built a tool that turns a pasted job description into a personalized outreach email and a first-30-days plan grounded in my real track record. Here is the funnel, the prompt, and why grounding beats prompting.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/technical-seo-for-your-own-portfolio.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>SEO</b><span>2026-08-07</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2>Technical SEO on My Own Portfolio: How to Inspect It</h2><p>I ran the same technical-SEO checklist I use for clients on my own site: semantic HTML, one h1 per page, JSON-LD Person + FAQ schema, canonical URLs, Open Graph, sitemap and robots. Here is the checklist, and how you can verify each item.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/creative-predictor-ai-predicts-your-ads-performance.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>Paid Media</b><span>2026-08-07</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2>Creative Predictor: My AI That Predicts Ad Performance Before You Spend</h2><p>I built Creative Predictor because in paid media, the version of the ad wins. Paste a creative and it predicts its CTR, engagement and conversion using Groq Llama 3.3, OpenAI and HuggingFace — with 20+ modules for quality score, A/B testing, competitor decoding and landing-page analysis.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/pricing-a-growth-saas-you-built-solo.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>SaaS</b><span>2026-08-07</span><span>7 min read</span></div><h2>Pricing a Growth SaaS You Built Solo</h2><p>Hook AI is a marketing copy engine I built, launched and charged for solo. Pricing a product when you are the marketer, builder and founder is a different game — here is the thinking: value first, anchoring, packaging, and the one number that actually moves revenue.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/hook-ai-the-copy-engine-that-writes-conversion-hooks.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>AI Tools</b><span>2026-08-07</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2>Hook AI: The Copy Engine I Built to Write Conversion-Ready Hooks</h2><p>Hook AI is a marketing copy engine I built and launched solo: conversion-ready hooks, headlines and ad copy across 15+ niches, with its own SEO program, email flows and A/B hero testing. Built on Next.js, Supabase, TypeScript, Razorpay and Groq.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/ai-growth-strategy-generator-plan-in-minutes.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>AI Tools</b><span>2026-08-07</span><span>5 min read</span></div><h2>AI Growth Strategy Generator: A Marketing Plan in Minutes, Not Weeks</h2><p>Most strategy docs die in a deck. I built the AI Growth Strategy Generator so a business can turn industry, budget and KPI targets into a personalized, budget-optimized marketing plan with effort-vs-impact scoring — in minutes, not weeks.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/case-study-restructuring-paid-media-cut-cpl-30.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>Case Study</b><span>2026-08-07</span><span>7 min read</span></div><h2>Case Study: How a Paid Media Restructure Cut Cost-Per-Lead 30% and Lifted ROAS to 5.5x</h2><p>A client account that had quietly degraded: cost-per-lead creeping toward Rs.1,100, ROAS parked at 3.2x. By consolidating 40+ ad groups, moving to target-CPA bidding and A/B testing creatives, cost-per-lead fell to Rs.770 and ROAS reached 5.5x. Here is exactly what changed.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n<a class=\"postcard\" href=\"https://vamshidharm.vercel.app/blog/case-study-organic-traffic-15-percent-combined-with-paid.html\"><div class=\"pmeta\"><b>Case Study</b><span>2026-08-08</span><span>6 min read</span></div><h2>Case Study: Lifting Organic Traffic ~15% While Paid Media Held the Line</h2><p>At Autozilla Software Solutions I own the whole growth mix, so organic and paid had to work as one. This is the organic side: a technical-SEO pass, a content audit, and measuring the +15% traffic growth that groups carried — with the exact checklist I use on any site.</p><span class=\"poststamp\">Read →</span></a>\n</div></section>";
